OL,5,G2220 Sean Lock: Keep It Light
OL,6,     FSean Lock's stand-up is a blend of
OL,7,     Ffinely tuned hyperactive
OL,8,     Fimagination, surreal imagery and
OL,9,     Finsightful observations, from the
OL,10,     Fprice of cinema food to jewellery
OL,11,     Fheists.
OL,12,G2325 The Kitchen
OL,13,     F(2023) Daniel Kaluuya and Kibwe
OL,14,     FTavares' action thriller. In a
OL,15,     Fdystopian future London where
OL,16,     Fsocial housing is being
OL,17,     Feradicated, the residents of The
OL,18,     FKitchen fight to save their
OL,19,     Fcommunity.
